"你的记录如何处理" = "How your records are handled";
"WatchMind 默认在设备上保存和处理录音、文字、健康资料与复盘。基础记录不需要账号，不包含广告或分析 SDK。" = "WatchMind stores and processes recordings, text, health data and reviews on your device by default. Basic recording needs no account and includes no advertising or analytics SDKs.";
"只有你开启观察或明确开始录音后才使用麦克风；没有触发前的声音。HealthKit、语音识别与麦克风权限可在系统设置中分别管理。" = "The microphone is used only after you enable observation or explicitly start recording. There is no audio from before a trigger. Manage HealthKit, speech recognition and microphone permissions separately in system settings.";
"身体信号、实际原话和 AI 的解释是不同层次的资料。心率与 HRV 不能直接证明心情、疾病或他人意图。" = "Body signals, actual words and AI interpretations are different kinds of evidence. Heart rate and HRV cannot establish an emotion, illness or another person's intention.";
"本机与外部 AI" = "On-device and external AI";
"本机转写不自动切换到云端。Apple 本机模型是否可用取决于设备、地区、系统和模型就绪状态。" = "On-device transcription never automatically switches to the cloud. Apple's local model depends on device, region, system and model readiness.";
"只有在你选定片段、核对输入并确认发送后，复盘功能才向所选接口发送相应文字、身体信号、历史基线和问题；不发送原始音频或整个档案。" = "Only after you select a fragment, review the input and confirm sharing does AI review send the selected words, body signals, historical baselines and question to your chosen endpoint. It does not send raw audio or your entire archive.";
"自定义接口和供应商可能保留请求并关联其账户。请先查看该服务的政策、地区和计费规则；取消请求不保证撤销已产生的费用。" = "Custom endpoints and providers may retain requests and associate them with an account. Check their policies, region and billing rules first. Cancelling a request may not reverse charges already incurred.";
"保留、导出与删除" = "Retention, export and deletion";
"本地档案使用系统文件保护，应用主动创建的资料目录排除系统备份。API 密钥单独保存在设备钥匙串，不加入档案导出。" = "Local records use system file protection, and the app's data directory is excluded from system backups. API keys stay separately in this device's Keychain and are not included in archive exports.";
"默认保留原音频。可为新会话选择完整转写后的清理；失败或部分成功不自动删除声音。已清理音频无法播放或重新转写。" = "Original audio is retained by default. New sessions can opt into cleanup after complete transcription; failed or partial processing does not automatically remove audio. Cleaned audio cannot be played or transcribed again.";
"导出文件可能包含私人文字与健康信息，请存放到你信任的位置。删除与卸载可能导致不可恢复的数据丢失；当前支持的导出与恢复范围请查看数据管理页面。" = "Exported files may contain private words and health information. Store them somewhere you trust. Deletion and uninstalling may cause irreversible loss; check Data Management for the export and restore options currently supported.";
"发布者与完整政策" = "Publisher and full policy";
"发布主体" = "Publisher";
"打开完整隐私政策" = "Open full privacy policy";
"完整隐私政策尚未配置" = "Full privacy policy is not configured";
"这是本机构建的处理说明，不替代发布者的完整法律政策。发布者必须配置真实主体、公开政策与支持联系方式，才能用于公开发布。" = "This is the build's local processing explanation, not the publisher's complete legal policy. Public distribution requires an actual publisher, public policy and support contact.";
"帮助与联系支持" = "Help & support";
"隐私与数据处理" = "Privacy & data handling";
"使用帮助" = "Using WatchMind";
"没有触发录音时，请先确认已开启观察、应用在前台、设备解锁且有新鲜心率样本。普通手表心率可能较稀疏，不保证实时触发。" = "If recording does not trigger, check that observation is enabled, the app is in front, the device is unlocked and fresh heart samples are available. Ordinary Watch samples can be sparse, so real-time triggering is not guaranteed.";
"来电、锁屏或失去前台可能暂停录音。查看顶部状态条和处理中心，在条件允许时继续，录音空档不会补造。" = "Calls, locking or leaving the foreground may pause recording. Check the top status strip and Processing Center to resume when allowed. Missing audio is never invented.";
"转写或 AI 失败时先保留原始记录，核对处理状态。请勿为了重试而卸载应用；卸载可能删除本地资料。" = "If transcription or AI fails, retain the original recording and check processing status. Do not uninstall just to retry; uninstalling may delete local data.";
"联系支持" = "Contact support";
"打开支持页面" = "Open support page";
"支持联系方式尚未配置。请向提供此构建的开发者反馈；正式发布前必须配置真实支持页面。" = "Support contact is not configured. Contact the developer who supplied this build. A real support page is required before public distribution.";
"应用版本" = "App version";
"分享不含正文的诊断信息" = "Share diagnostics without content";
"只有你主动分享才会离开应用。诊断仅包含版本、系统、语言和运行状态，不包含录音、文字、健康值、接口地址或密钥。" = "Diagnostics leave the app only when you choose to share. They contain version, system, language and runtime status, with no recordings, words, health values, endpoints or keys.";
"使用可访问时段列表" = "Use accessible time-range list";
"{0} 个心率点" = "{0} heart samples";
"选择后查看该时段的实际线索。" = "Select to inspect the actual signals in this interval.";
"有活动聚合线索" = "Activity aggregate clues available";
"有心率样本" = "Heart samples available";
"没有可用线索" = "No available clues";
"{0} – {1}，{2}，{3} 个心率点" = "{0} – {1}, {2}, {3} heart samples";
"连续语词合并为短句，保留全部文字、所选样本和录音空档；完整输入包含单位与聚合窗口。" = "Continuous word tokens are grouped into short passages, keeping all words, selected samples and recording gaps. The full input includes units and aggregation windows.";
"本机模型按上下文预算分批分析，再合并复盘；不会遗漏所选片段，较长输入可能需要更多时间。" = "The on-device model analyzes bounded batches and combines them without omitting selected passages. Longer input may take more time.";
"分析接口：{0}" = "Analysis endpoint: {0}";
"删除队列与现有录音冲突，已停止清理以保护文件。" = "The deletion queue conflicts with a live recording. Cleanup stopped to protect the files.";
"文件删除尚未完成，已保存待办；可在存储管理中重试。" = "File deletion is pending. Its intent is saved; retry in storage management.";
"转写已暂停，已保存的分段会保留；可在处理中心继续。" = "Transcription paused. Saved chunks are kept; continue in the processing center.";
"可用空间不足，已安全结束录音并保留文件。请释放空间后再继续。" = "Free space is low. Recording ended safely and files were kept. Free space before continuing.";
"存储恢复" = "Storage recovery";
"已暂停采集以保护记录。释放空间后可重试保存，或先导出内存中的文字档案。" = "Capture is paused to protect records. Free space and retry saving, or export the text archive from memory first.";
"重试保存与待删除文件" = "Retry saving and pending deletions";
"待删除文件" = "Pending file deletions";
"仍有 {0} 个音频等待删除；只有保存引用变更后才会删除文件。" = "{0} audio files await deletion. Files are removed only after reference changes are saved.";
"暂停转写，保留已完成分段" = "Pause transcription and keep completed chunks";
"隐私与数据说明" = "Privacy & data information";
"帮助与支持" = "Help & support";
"继续未完成转写" = "Continue unfinished transcription";
"重新识别全部片段" = "Transcribe all chunks again";

"删除来源录音会移除关联标记、高光和复盘；关联长期记忆会停用但保留文字，若也要删除请到记忆页操作。清除全部记录会移除这些资料。" = "Deleting a recording removes linked markers, highlights and reviews. Linked memories are disabled but keep their text; delete them on the memory page if needed. Clearing all records removes these items.";
"历史心率值不可用，原话仍可核对。" = "Historical heart values are unavailable. You can still check the original words.";
"今天有 {0} 条记录，其中 {1} 条有可用语音；部分历史心率值不可用，不作为身体变化证据。\n" = "There are {0} records today, {1} with voice context. Some historical heart values are unavailable and are not evidence of bodily change.\n";
"历史显著度数据不可用，不用于身体状态判断。" = "Historical salience data is unavailable and is not used to interpret bodily state.";
"有逐词时间的录音可继续已完成分段；无对齐旧全文会保留旧文，并可能重新识别全部片段。" = "Aligned recordings resume completed chunks. Legacy text without alignment is kept and may require a full reread.";
